@startuml
title Activity 19 - Finance Budget Adjustment Approval

|Treasury/Finance Officer|
start
:Open Budget Approval Queue;
|Frontend|
:Load pending adjustment requests;
|Backend|
:Verify Finance role and department;
if (Authorized?) then (yes)
  :Return request, forecast and department budget;
  |Treasury/Finance Officer|
  :Review amount, reason and upcoming events;
  :Compare forecast and available budget;
  :Choose Approve or Reject;
  if (Reject?) then (yes)
    :Enter rejection reason;
    |Backend|
    :Set request status = REJECTED;
    :Release any temporary reservation;
    :Notify submitting department;
    stop
  else (Approve)
    |Backend|
    :Set request status = APPROVED;
    :Create or update monthly budget;
    :Write Finance approval source;
    :Notify submitting department;
    :Send review email;
    stop
  endif
else (no)
  :Return 403 and hide queue;
  stop
endif
@enduml
